# Terraform state + local values (contain secrets/account specifics) - never commit.
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars

# Build artifacts
build/

# Historical 2026 CloudFormation reference (may contain account ARNs / secret refs).
reference/

# Live deployment snapshot - contains real account id / domain / IPs (operational, local only).
DEPLOYMENT-STATUS.md

# Misc
*.log
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
